<p>You are light on your feet, handling your armour better. Each step you take regenerates <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.20, 0.40, 0.60, 0.80, 1.00</acronym> stamina, and your fatigue is permanently reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.9%, 2.7%, 4.1%, 5.2%, 6.2%.</acronym></p><p>At level 3 you are able to walk so lightly that you never trigger traps that require pressure.</p>